{"step_index":303,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:40:22Z","thinking":"**Developing Document Scanner Service**\n\nI'm currently creating `src/services/documentScannerService.ts`. The core focus is on encapsulating edge detection, flattening perspective, and attempting integration with native document camera scanners (VisionKit/ML Kit). This service aims to streamline the document scanning process within the application by centralizing these essential functionalities.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import { Platform } from 'react-native';\\nimport * as ImagePicker from 'expo-image-picker';\\n\\nexport interface ScannedDocumentResult {\\n  uri: string;\\n  width?: number;\\n  height?: number;\\n  sizeBytes?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class DocumentScannerService {\\n  /**\\n   * Scans a paper document with native edge-detection, perspective correction, and shadow removal.\\n   * - In Native Dev Builds: Uses Apple VisionKit / Google MLKit Document Scanner.\\n   * - In Expo Go / Web: Uses Camera with interactive boundary cropping (allowsEditing).\\n   */\\n  static async scanDocument(): Promise<string | null> {\\n    // 1. Try Native Document Scanner plugin (VisionKit on iOS / MLKit on Android)\\n    if (Platform.OS !== 'web') {\\n      try {\\n        const DocumentScanner = await import('react-native-document-scanner-plugin');\\n        if (DocumentScanner && DocumentScanner.default && DocumentScanner.default.scanDocument) {\\n          const { scannedImages } = await DocumentScanner.default.scanDocument({\\n            maxNumDocuments: 1,\\n            letUserAdjustCrop: true,\\n          });\\n          if (scannedImages && scannedImages.length > 0) {\\n            return await this.downsampleAndCompress(scannedImages[0]);\\n          }\\n        }\\n      } catch (e) {\\n        // Fall through to interactive camera cropper\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    // 2. Interactive Camera Cropper Fallback (Works in Expo Go & Standard Mobile)\\n    const permission = await ImagePicker.requestCameraPermissionsAsync();\\n    if (!permission.granted) {\\n      throw new Error('Camera permission is required to scan lead sheets.');\\n    }\\n\\n    const result = await ImagePicker.launchCameraAsync({\\n      mediaTypes: ImagePicker.MediaTypeOptions.Images,\\n      allowsEditing: true,\\n      quality: 0.85,\\n    });\\n\\n    if (!result.canceled && result.assets[0]) {\\n      return await this.downsampleAndCompress(result.assets[0].uri);\\n    }\\n\\n    return null;\\n  }\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Universal On-Device Downsampling & Compression Pipeline:\\n   * Resizes raw 48MP iPhone ph\n<truncated 1959 bytes>","Description":"\"DocumentScannerService for native document edge detection, perspective flattening, and universal <250KB image downsampling\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\snap-dialer\\\\src\\\\services\\\\documentScannerService.ts\"","toolAction":"\"Writing DocumentScannerService\"","toolSummary":"\"Write DocumentScannerService.ts\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
